# Built output. It is generated from src/ by build.mjs, and publish-preview.sh builds it
# fresh before it publishes, so a copy in the history buys nothing. Tracked, it conflicted on
# every branch that had also been built, and a conflict in a generated file says nothing about
# whether the code disagrees: the resolution was always one more build.
